---
config:
  theme: redux
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant AC as AccountsController
    participant AS as AccountService
    participant AR as AccountRepository
    participant DB as Database

    User->>AC: UpdateProfile / ChangePassword
    AC->>AS: UpdateAccountAsync / ChangePasswordAsync
    Note over AS: Validation Logic
    AS->>AR: UpdateAsync / UpdatePasswordAsync
    AR->>DB: SQL Update
    DB-->>AR: OK
    AR-->>AS: Updated Entity
    AS-->>AC: Success Result
    AC-->>User: 200 OK / Redirect